T2 Compare Learning to Infer Graphics Programs from Hand-Drawn Images with Raven: Rethinking Automated Assessment for Scratch Programs via Video-Grounded Evaluation. What visual evidence does each use, how does it relate to programs, how is success evaluated, and what uncertainty or scope limit remains?
