- **Learning to Infer Graphics Programs from Hand-Drawn Images** — `DBLP_conf_nips_EllisRST18.pdf` — page 1 [2]
- **Learning to Infer Graphics Programs from Hand-Drawn Images** — `DBLP_journals_corr_EllisRST17.pdf` — page 1 [5]
- **Learning to Infer Graphics Programs from Hand-Drawn Images** — `DBLP_conf_nips_EllisRST18.pdf` — page 9 [1]
- **Raven: Rethinking Automated Assessment for Scratch Programs via Video-Grounded Evaluation** — `DBLP_conf_pldi_SinghGS13.pdf` — page 2 [3]
- **Raven: Rethinking Automated Assessment for Scratch Programs via Video-Grounded Evaluation** — `DBLP_conf_pldi_SinghGS13.pdf` — page 11 [4]
