- *sk_p: a neural program corrector for MOOCs* — `DBLP_conf_oopsla_PuNSB16.pdf`, page 11 [3]  
- *The Three Pillars of Machine Programming* — `DBLP_conf_mapl_GottschlichSTCR18.pdf`, page 6 [4]  
- *Challenges and Paths Towards AI for Software Engineering* — `DBLP_journals_corr_abs-2503-22625.pdf`, page 33 [5]
